  "description": "Meet the Actbest Cozy — a powerful, comfortable, and smart step-thru fat tire eBike designed for everyday commuting, city cruising, park paths, and weekend rides.\nWith a 1800W peak motor, 48V 15.6Ah battery, up to 80 miles of range, and 24\" × 3.0\" fat tires, Cozy gives you stronger support, better stability, and more confidence across mixed everyday roads.\nThe low step-thru frame, adjustable 10°–40° handlebar, front fork suspension, rear rack, fenders, LCD display, and Bluetooth app connectivity make Cozy a practical everyday eBike for work, errands, grocery runs, and relaxed weekend rides.\nFrom daily commutes to weekend cruising, Cozy is built to make every ride feel easier, smoother, and more comfortable.",
